                "message": "Remove Denote from sp-refile: file split-out notes by tag\n\n- sp-refile no longer requires denote, so sp-vulpea-ext and sp-org-ext load.\n- sp-split--denote-rename becomes sp-split--file-by-tags: asks for tags and\n  moves the new note into its tag folder (sp-notes-filing-folder).\n- sp-split-denote-names is an obsolete alias of sp-split-file-by-tags.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNi9hnWskPJso94gsTkL",
